# CODEOWNERS for velt-js/agent-skills
#
# GitHub auto-requests review from the listed teams/users when a PR touches
# matching paths. This file is the primary review-routing mechanism for the
# skills-sync pipeline; the bot does not assign reviewers explicitly.
#
# ⚠ Replace the placeholder team/user names below with real GitHub handles
#   before merging. The format is one of:
#     @username                  — a single user
#     @velt-js/team-slug         — a GitHub team within the org
#     username@example.com       — a user by email (less common)
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins. Specific paths must come
# after general ones.

# ─── Default owner for everything in the repo ──────────────────────────────
